a deliberate toolbar click, not tab focus, so switching tabs without clicking
leaves it where it was. `cardByArticleKey` uses `.first()` because `articleKey`
is indexed but not unique: a pre-version-2 board can already hold a duplicate
pair, and `.first()` returns the older of them rather than throwing.
